title: Whether the case for skg reaches a stranger is learned, either way.
pid: 2be85235-a123-4c3f-b1b7-9a7584b70ed2
body: |2-
  This team's use cannot show it, since our notes are kept because
  missions require them: [[id:dbfdf59f-c44c-440c-8488-eb5b20a04ade][For this team the disparity is total, and notes are kept anyway because a mission makes keeping them the job]].
